==Battleground==
*1 [[Mobius (Enemy)|Mobius]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*6 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*4 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Because of Mobius's slow attack, you can rush it down with the help of [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]]. Even if A. Baha gets hit, he has enough health to get right back up and finish the job.

